# Agreed 2026-11-06: normalize line endings to LF in the repo; mark binaries
# so git never attempts a text conversion on them. The PDFs and the GGUF
# model file are the critical cases — a mangled binary in history is
# unrecoverable.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.gguf binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.zip binary
